graft is a local-first composition workspace. The incremental compiler
is the build engine. Runtime: ffmpeg and ffprobe on PATH. graft shells
out; it does not link x264.

https://github.com/eonik-ai/graft

Build-time: Rust toolchain (rustc/cargo) must be installed.
Runtime: ffmpeg/ffprobe from Slackware (stock package); not listed in
REQUIRES because it is part of Slackware itself.
